# Google Play Provider

{{ .Description | trimspace }}

Published to the [OpenTofu Registry](https://search.opentofu.org/provider/mathgaps/googleplay)
as `mathgaps/googleplay`. It is not on the Terraform Registry: it works with
Terraform too, but only when installed from a
[mirror](https://developer.hashicorp.com/terraform/cli/config/config-file#provider-installation)
you populate yourself from the GitHub releases.

